    "homeType": "CONDO",
    "description": "Thoughtfully Updated Noe Valley Condo in Ideal Location. This spacious one-bedroom, one-bath condo with parking offers a comfortable and refined living space in the heart of Noe Valley. The recently renovated kitchen features quartz countertops, custom cabinetry, and new stainless steel appliances blending functionality with clean, modern design.  The bathroom has been tastefully refreshed with a new vanity, classic subway tile, and a new bathtub, creating a simple yet inviting space to unwind. Throughout the home, you'll find new hardwood floors and updated light fixtures that add warmth and modern touches.  Additional highlights include one-car parking, a dedicated storage cabinet, shared laundry and access to a common patio in a quiet, well-maintained four-unit building with low HOA dues. Set in a highly walkable neighborhood, you'll be just minutes from the shops and restaurants along 24th Street, as well as Glen Park, the Inner Mission, and convenient public transit options. Walkscore: 94, Walker's Paradise and 91, Biker's Paradise."
  },
